sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as 管理员
    participant PM as ProjectManage.vue
    participant PC as ProjectController
    participant PS as ProjectService
    participant PMap as ProjectMapper
    participant IM as IssueMapper
    participant UM as UserMapper
    participant RM as RoleMapper
    participant AL as AdminLayout
    participant ASD as AdminStyleDrawer
    participant UT as applyAdminStyleVars
    participant GEH as GlobalExceptionHandler

    == R4 停用校验（仅阻止 + 文案提示，不列问题编号） ==
    Admin->>PM: 切换项目状态 启用→停用
    PM->>PC: PUT /api/projects/{id}  (完整 payload: name,status,leaderId,memberIds)
    PC->>PS: updateProject(id, req)  @Transactional
    PS->>PMap: selectById(id)
    PMap-->>PS: exist(status=1)
    alt req.status==0 且 exist.status==1
        PS->>IM: selectCount(projectId, status!=CLOSED(4), deleted=0)
        IM-->>PS: openCount
        alt openCount > 0
            PS-->>GEH: throw BizException(PROJECT_HAS_OPEN_ISSUES=40020)
            GEH-->>PM: Result{code:40020, "该项目下存在未关闭问题，无法停用"}
            PM-->>Admin: 回滚 row.status + ElMessage.error(拦截器)
        else openCount == 0
            PS->>PMap: updateById(exist)
            PMap-->>PS: ok
            PS-->>PC: ProjectVO
            PC-->>PM: Result.success
            PM-->>Admin: ElMessage.success("状态已更新")
        end
    else 非 1→0（放行）
        PS->>PMap: updateById(exist)
        PMap-->>PS: ok
        PS-->>PC: ProjectVO
        PC-->>PM: Result.success
    end

    == R2 项目分页批量回填负责人/成员（一次 selectBatchIds，避免 N+1） ==
    Admin->>PM: 打开项目管理页
    PM->>PC: GET /api/projects?page&size
    PC->>PS: pageProjects(page, size)
    PS->>PMap: selectPage(Page, wrapper)
    PMap-->>PS: List~Project~（当页记录）
    PS->>PS: batchUsers(records): 汇总 leaderId + 切分 memberIds
    PS->>UM: selectBatchIds(所有去重 userId)   %% 仅 1 次
    UM-->>PS: List~User~
    PS->>RM: selectList() 构建 roleId→roleName 映射
    RM-->>PS: List~Role~
    PS->>PS: toVO(p, userMap): 回填 leaderName / members(UserBriefVO)
    PS-->>PC: PageResult~ProjectVO~（含 leaderName, members）
    PC-->>PM: Result.success
    PM-->>Admin: 表格展示负责人 + 项目成员(首3名+等N人)

    == R7 风格抽屉即时应用（作用域仅 AdminLayout，不污染前台） ==
    Note over AL: onMounted 读取 if_admin_style
    AL->>AL: loadAdminStyle() 从 localStorage 解析
    AL->>UT: applyAdminStyleVars(state, rootEl=.if-layout--admin)
    UT->>UT: 在根元素写内联 CSS 变量(--theme-color/--admin-sidebar-bg/--if-topbar-position...)
    UT->>AL: 设置 data-if-admin-style 属性（不写 document.documentElement）
    Admin->>AL: 点击头像下拉「整体风格设置」
    AL->>ASD: 打开 ElDrawer（command=styleSettings）
    Admin->>ASD: 切换主题色/模式/侧栏类型等任一控件
    ASD->>UT: onChange → applyAdminStyleVars(state, document.querySelector('.if-layout--admin'))
    UT->>UT: 即时刷新后台根元素变量（前台 UserLayout 无感知）
    ASD->>ASD: saveAdminStyle(state) → localStorage['if_admin_style']
    Note over AL,ASD: 刷新页面后 onMounted 重新应用，保持偏好
